{"updated_at": {"date": {"d": "10", "m": "09", "Y": "2026"}, "time": {"H": "06", "M": "46", "S": "52"}}, "news": [{"title": "Ensure due diligence to curb insolvency framework misuse: IBBI to insolvency professionals", "para": "The Insolvency and Bankruptcy Board of India (IBBI) has issued a warning to professionals against the potential misuse of the IBC framework. To safeguard against companies evading tax responsibilities, professionals are urged to undertake thorough due diligence. Key warning signs include shared promoters and overlapping creditor committees. Should any fraud be suspected, insolvency experts must promptly file with the Adjudicating Authority.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/regulatory/ensure-due-diligence-to-curb-insolvency-framework-misuse-ibbi-to-insolvency-professionals/133993408?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-116420/133993408.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "regulatory"}, {"title": "Telangana high court orders GHMC to display building permits at construction sites", "para": "The Telangana High Court has made it compulsory for construction sites to exhibit their building permissions visibly. Civic authorities are tasked with the responsibility to oversee ongoing constructions and stop any unauthorized activities right away. The court will seal any structures lacking proper permissions, responding to a businessman\u2019s grievance against GHMC's inaction. The ruling draws attention to the infringement of municipal building regulations and the misuse of self-certification by contractors.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/regulatory/telangana-high-court-orders-ghmc-to-display-building-permits-at-construction-sites/133992893?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-112938/133992893.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "regulatory"}, {"title": "For elderly owners in Pune, redevelopment stirs up hope & doubts", "para": "Elderly residents face significant challenges and uncertainties during housing redevelopment projects. Many fear not living to see their new homes after lengthy delays and disputes.  Rising rents and legal complications create financial and emotional burdens for seniors.  Disagreements among members and developers often halt progress for years.  A streamlined approval process is needed to ensure timely and fair redevelopment outcomes.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/residential/for-elderly-owners-in-pune-redevelopment-stirs-up-hope-doubts/133992692?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-294406/133992692.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "residential"}]}